### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Google",
  "role": "Software Engineer",
  "notes": "Applied via referral"
}

###

### Get All
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

###

### Get By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/search?company=Google

###

### Update Status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INTERVIEW"
}

###

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/statistics